2. NCS and public-data sources
------------------------------

HRMCP normalizes and links National Competency Standards (NCS) material whose
source provider is principally the Human Resources Development Service of
Korea (한국산업인력공단). As of the review date, the following official
data.go.kr API records used by the active product display
"이용허락범위 제한 없음" for those API records:

- NCS reference information (record 15128213; hrdkapi/NCS004, NCS005, NCS006)
- NCS training-course information (record 15086447; ncsTrainingCource/openapi18)
- NCS competency-unit qualification items (record 15074404; ncsClCdJm)
- NCS job-base competencies (record 15086440; ncsJobBase/openapi19)

API access approval, credentials, traffic limits, attribution requirements,
third-party rights, and current record terms still apply. This list does not
mean that every file or web page used by the project has unrestricted terms.
The full source-by-source inventory, official links, code paths, storage
tables, product status, and verification caveats are maintained in
DATA_SOURCE_NOTICE.md.

3. Direct ncs.go.kr collection paths
-------------------------------------

The scripts/ncs_learning_module_*.py files handle learning-module pages or
files obtained directly from ncs.go.kr. The NCS copyright policy identifies
learning modules as KOGL Type 2 material, which prohibits commercial use, and
individual files may contain third-party content. These legacy/reference
artifacts are not active HRMCP serving evidence. Verify each file's current
notice and third-party rights before redistribution, commercial use, or
serving-snapshot inclusion.

src/ncs_mcp/collect_sqf_library.py reads SQF library posts and attachments
directly from ncs.go.kr. Those legacy/reference materials require post- and
file-level rights review before redistribution or deployment inclusion. An
open-data API record must not be assumed to govern a separate direct-download
path.

